5,1,1,talk,Toshio,,We need a sustainable system. I suggest we look into the actual costs and usage patterns first.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I agree. We should establish a factual baseline of the time and effort required before deciding.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,A logical approach. I'm curious if the current distribution of labor actually reflects the distribution of usage.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,Let's make this interesting! I want to know why the bathroom is a gamble every morning.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Midori,,I just want us all to stay happy. Maybe we can see what worked for the people here before us?,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Midori, that's a fair point. However, financial transparency is just as important for long-term peace.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Toshio, costs are one thing, but the actual hours spent are what usually cause the friction.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,Indeed. It would be a shame to design a system based on assumptions rather than empirical data.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,Boring! Let's look at the chat logs. I bet there's some juicy drama about who forgot to scrub the tub.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@May, let's try to keep it positive. I'm more worried about how we communicate when things get messy.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,pass,Toshio,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
16,1,3,pass,Ryuji,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I believe we have enough direction. Let's select our focus areas to avoid redundant effort.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,May,,I'm ready to dive in. I'll find out where the gaps are.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Midori,,I agree. Let's gather the information and then talk it through calmly.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
