35,2,1,talk,Toshio,,It seems we are wasting money on duplicate supplies and the professional option is quite expensive.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,The time commitment is higher than I expected. A full pass takes over an hour and a half.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,Fascinating. It appears the burden of cleaning is not proportional to the actual presence or usage of the space.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,May,,"Oh, it's even worse than I thought! We're all playing by different rules. No wonder the bathroom is a surprise.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Midori,,I've learned that the previous tenants struggled with their relationship. I really want us to avoid that.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Ryuji, if it takes that long, a rotating schedule might be too taxing for some.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"Exactly. If we outsource, we must consider that we still have to tidy up before they arrive.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Toshio, @Ryuji, if some of us are rarely here, a flat rotation is logically flawed. It's an unfair tax on the absent.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,May,,And some of us are basically professional chefs while others just use a kettle. Let's be real about the mess!,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@May, you're right about the usage. I noticed the kitchen load is very unevenly distributed.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Toshio,,We need a system that tracks both the financial contribution for supplies and the labor.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,"I am concerned that a simple rotation doesn't account for the ""hidden"" time of preparation.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,I propose we consider a usage-based model or a hybrid system that accounts for absences.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,May,,"I just want a checklist. If we all agree on what ""done"" means, I can stop bracing myself for the bathroom.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Midori,,"A checklist sounds lovely, as long as it doesn't feel like we're policing each other.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Toshio,,Let's ensure the final decision includes a clear method for settling the supply costs.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,Agreed. But the primary focus must be the time burden. It's too high to ignore.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,I'm sure we can find a mathematical middle ground that satisfies both the residents and the visitors.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,May,,"As long as it's not boring and actually works, I'm in.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Midori,,Let's choose the option that keeps us as friends. That's the most important part.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
