60,3,1,talk,Toshio,,"Option B is expensive, but it removes the interpersonal conflict. However, we must settle the bills strictly.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,"Option B still requires prep time. Option A allows us to manage our own schedules, which is more efficient.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Option C is the most egalitarian on paper, but the least fair in practice given our varying levels of presence.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,May,,Option A is perfect. I can make sure the bathroom is actually clean to my standards without arguing with anyone.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Midori,,I'm worried Option A might lead to resentment if one person's task is harder than another's.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Midori, that's why we should rotate the assignments every few months, not keep them permanently.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Ryuji,,"If we rotate, we're back to the scheduling conflicts of Option C. I prefer the autonomy of Option A.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Ryuji, I agree. Option A allows those who use the space more to potentially take on more, or simply manage their time better.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,May,,"Exactly! Let me handle the bathroom, and I'll make it a sanctuary. Just keep me away from the kitchen.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Midori,,"If we go with Option A, can we agree to help each other out if someone is overwhelmed?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Toshio,,"As long as the supply costs are handled separately and transparently, I can support Option A.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Ryuji,,It is the most rational way to minimize the impact on our individual schedules.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,"It transforms a collective obligation into a personal responsibility, which is far more manageable.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,May,,It's a deal. I'm voting for the one that lets me control the chaos.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Midori,,I'll support Option A if we promise to talk about it openly before it becomes a problem.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
